  "term": "Compulsive Personality Disorder",
  "definition": "Compulsive personality disorder is a disorder marked by restricted emotional expression and an excessively conventional, serious, formal, and stingy style. It also involves intense concern with details, rules, order, schedules, and lists, along with stubborn insistence on doing things one's own way, strained relationships, and indecision from fear of making mistakes.",
